// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3700004765" "You make the hardest fights seem easy. The Platonic Solids are safe, and you managed it before the Warriors did any damage with them. Actually, my MAGI contacts tell me we were pretty lucky. The Octahedron was cracked centuries ago, and the most powerful Platonic Solid, the Dodecahedron, was lost in the destruction of the Library of Alexandria. Still, if they'd learned enough, the Warriors might have been able to make new ones. The city owes you again."
// RandomFameString :
"P3814469525" "I heard that the Warriors are really worried about {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2271922489" "I know things seem dark, but don't let it bring you down too far. My MAGI contacts tell me that we were pretty lucky. The Octahedron was cracked centuries ago, and the most powerful Platonic Solid, the Dodecahedron, was lost in the destruction of the Library of Alexandria. We'll just have to keep our eyes on this new Pythagorean cult."
// RandomFameString :
"P709431388" "I heard that the Warriors aren't even worried about {HeroName} anymore."

