"P1537002325" "Breaking up that tournament probably saved lives in the end. Neither the Tsoo nor the Warriors really know how to loose gracefully. The real shame is that they couldn't put their strength to better use, like you do. So, just in case no one's said it recently, thank you, {HeroName}. On behalf of all Paragon City, thank you."
