// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Warriors_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4081904182" "The Warriors have been spreading rumors that they have some kind of new invincible fighting technique. I doubt that this new technique really exists, but the rumors are enough to worry a lot of people. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need a hero to hit the streets and defeat a few Warriors to show that this invincible technique isn't.</a> They're supposed to be teaching this technique all over Talos Island, but defeating Warriors anywhere should still be a good demonstration."
// AcceptString :
"P3209140554" "Hit the streets and defeat a few Warriors"
// SendOffString :
"P374589606" "The Warriors can be dangerous, {HeroName}, but they aren't invincible. I know you can take them."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3409788959" "Disprove Warrior invincibility"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1429440860" "You'll need to defeat a few more Warriors to prove that they aren't invincible."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1011671062" "You have proved that the Warriors are not invincible."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2705673436" "Good job, {HeroName}. You showed that the Warriors' invincible technique was nothing more than a delusional fiction. The rumors have died down, and people can breathe easy again."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Warriors_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2430229738" "The Warriors have been out on the streets of Talos Island in force lately, trying to exert their control over the city zone. They've been harassing the locals, defacing city property, and generally causing a lot of havoc. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Someone needs to show them that they aren't the ruling power in Talos Island.</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P1796829584" "Show the Warriors they aren't the ruling power in Talos Island"
// SendOffString :
"P3405664820" "New Thebes and New Troy are typical Warrior hangouts. You could look for them there."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P733577050" "Combat Warriors on Talos Island"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3577748677" "You'll need to defeat a few more Warriors to show them that gangs don't control this city."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1523014032" "You have discouraged the Warriors from causing havoc on Talos Island."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3287329591" "The Warriors don't stand a chance against you, {HeroName}. Your dogged persistence has served you well."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Warriors_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2080967831" "A new wave of Warrior recruits have just hit the streets, and they're already terrorizing all of Talos Island. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'm looking for a hero brave enough to take the fight right back to the Warriors.</A> If that gang grows much larger, it may become impossible to contain."
// AcceptString :
"P2488680229" "Take the fight to the Warriors"
// SendOffString :
"P1754650146" "The Warriors have been doing a lot of recruiting in New Thebes and New Troy. You might want to start in those neighborhoods."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2015893182" "Combat Warriors in Talos Island"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3008345266" "I want you to take down a few more Warriors, {HeroName}. That gang is growing by leaps and bounds."

